    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have mastered two of the Words of Creation: the words of life and death. You therefore always have the @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplPowerWordH]{Power Word Heal} and @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplPowerWordK]{Power Word Kill} spells prepared. When you cast either spell, you can target a second creature with it if that creature is within 10 feet of the first target.</p><section id=\"secret-aHHp3ZnTrWPHHB7j\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>You are automatically granted these spells as you level up.</p></section>",
